sequenceDiagram
    participant A as AI Agent
    participant P as Provider (OJCP endpoint)
    participant D as Agent Key Directory
    participant H as Host named by agent_id

    Note over A,H: Signed request

    A->>A: sign request (HTTP Message Signatures)<br/>covered: @method @authority @path @query<br/>content-digest, signature-agent
    A->>P: tool call + Signature-Input / Signature<br/>Signature-Agent + Content-Digest

    Note over A,H: Verification (steps 1-5)

    P->>D: GET /.well-known/http-message-signatures-directory<br/>(HTTPS, SSRF-guarded, no private IPs)
    D-->>P: JWK Set
    P->>P: 1. resolve key by JWK thumbprint (keyid)
    P->>P: 2. verify signature (alg from key, not wire)
    P->>P: 3. Content-Digest matches body
    P->>P: 4. freshness (created/expires, window <= 300s)
    P->>P: 5. nonce not replayed for this keyid

    Note over A,H: Identity binding (steps 6-7)

    P->>P: 6. agent_id matches the grammar<br/>(lowercase LDH labels, never normalized)
    alt namespace binding
        P->>P: 7. reversed Signature-Agent host prefixes agent_id<br/>on a label boundary (wayfarer.ai → ai.wayfarer.*)
    else delegated binding
        P->>H: GET /.well-known/ojcp-agent.json<br/>(ai.wayfarer.agent → agent.wayfarer.ai)
        H-->>P: Agent Identity Document (agent_id, signers)
        P->>P: 7. Signature-Agent origin is listed in signers
    end

    Note over A,H: Policy (step 8 + required_for)

    alt all checks pass
        P->>P: 8. agent_id is verified
        P-->>A: tool result
    else signature required but missing/invalid
        P-->>A: error envelope<br/>(agent_signature_missing / _invalid / _expired /<br/>_nonce_replayed / agent_id_malformed / _identity_mismatch / ...)
    end

    Note over A,P: Session binding — submit_application SHOULD be<br/>signed by the same verified agent that began it
